# Tic-Tac-Toe (Wear OS) — files that must NEVER be committed.
# Anything that can sign a build, unlock a keystore, or identify a
# personal account stays local. See README.md ("Signing" + "Configuration").

# --- Signing keys and passwords (the critical ones) ---
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.pem
*.key
.ks-pass
config.env
*.env

# --- Build outputs (rebuilt by build.sh / build-bundle.sh) ---
*.apk
*.aab
*.idsig
out/
out-bundle/

# --- Internal Play Console notes ---
# play-listing.md holds account-specific material (signing fingerprints,
# store URLs, internal release notes). Keep it local; do not publish it.
play-listing.md

# --- Editor / OS noise ---
.DS_Store
*~
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
